Package: airqmra
Title: Inhalation Quantitative Microbial Risk Assessment
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Gaoshan", "Zhang", , "2024029025@chd.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive R package for quantitative microbial risk assessment (QMRA) 
    of airborne pathogens. It integrates Chinese population exposure databases, 
    dose-response models, one- and two-dimensional Monte Carlo simulation, 
    annual risk calculation, and advanced sensitivity analysis (Spearman, PRCC, 
    Morris, Sobol'). The package also includes an interactive Shiny application 
    and automated report generation following national technical guidelines.
